# Review gate for the files with the widest blast radius.
#
# komodo/gitops.py is the only git writer and holds every refusal; komodo/hooks/ runs on every
# commit and push in every repo that installed the hooks; komodo/rules/ and komodo/roles/ reach
# every worker and, through the adapters, every interactive session after the next install.

/komodo/gitops.py              @rdevitto86
/komodo/hooks/                 @rdevitto86
/komodo/workers/               @rdevitto86
/komodo/rules/                 @rdevitto86
/komodo/roles/                 @rdevitto86
/komodo/adapters/              @rdevitto86
